description: Automates opening a pull request and iterating on automated code-review bot comments (e.g. the "code-review" GitHub Action / Bugbot-style check) until no valid findings remain. Use when pushing your own branch and opening a PR, or when checking on a PR you already opened for outstanding bot review comments.
alwaysApply: false
